{"id":"mejora","lemma":"mejora","pos":"noun","rank":3606,"glosses":["improvement, improving, amelioration, betterment, refinement","enhancement, enhancing, upgrade, upgrading (in quality)","upturn"],"ipa":"/meˈxoɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mejoras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-mejora.wav","examples":[{"text":"Su francés mejora poco a poco.","en":"His French is improving little by little.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515922","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"French"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,6,"little by little"]]},{"text":"La vida no mejora.","en":"Life doesn't get any better.","words":[null,null,{"g":"no / not"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"the game"]]},{"text":"El ejercicio mejora la salud.","en":"Exercise improves health.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"exercise"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"bless you"}]},{"text":"Como los buenos vinos, él mejora con la edad.","en":"Like a good wine, he improves with age.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/517901","words":[{"g":"as"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"good","l":"bueno"},{"g":"wine","l":"vino"},{"g":"he"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"age"}]},{"text":"Mejora.","en":"It gets better.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440981","words":[null]}]}